{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國企業正越來越多地利用美國先進人工智能模型生成的內容，訓練本土AI模型，以應對美國持續收緊先進晶片出口限制帶來的算力壓力。路透社對300多份中國學術論文、專利、企業披露文件、招聘信息及政府文件進行審查後發現，這種被稱為「模型蒸餾」（Distillation）的技術，已經從學術研究逐漸擴展到中國AI產業的實際應用之中。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586784.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:51:18.012827+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:29:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:44:26.635115+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:44:26.635115+00:00","content_hash":"487e4db23b48ac52b69e314ebaeb931eab7cf23ec88916415b66544706d39fdb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}